* include udev rules in the linux installers by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1488
* Add ARM builds in CI by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1482
* Add save file prompt for BVH recordings by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1483
* Check monitor size before recovering old window state by @ImUrX in https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Server/pull/1470
